  <!-- EN: Disintegration Corrosion -->
  <GR_Disintegration_Corrosion.label>裂解侵蚀</GR_Disintegration_Corrosion.label>
  <!-- EN: The creature is being consumed by a lethal disintegrative corrosion, its armor relentlessly flaking away into nothingness, exposing vulnerable tissues beneath. Its movements turn sluggish and uncoordinated as its very flesh dissolves into molecular debris. -->
  <GR_Disintegration_Corrosion.description>该生物正被致命的裂解能量侵蚀，其装甲不断剥落，暴露出下方脆弱的组织。随着其肉体逐渐溶解为分子，它的动作将会变得迟缓且不协调。</GR_Disintegration_Corrosion.description>
